	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nThe battery is directly connected to Bucky via J1 and the power is directly transfered to the motors through J2. It is also connected to the bucks' input through VBuck_in. \nThe output of the buck are then connected to their respective voltage nets. \nThe same ground is used for the whole board.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
